<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-HABSUDOVA WINS CZECH INDOOR WOMEN'S TITLE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HABSUDOVA WINS CZECH INDOOR WOMEN'S TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>PROSTEJOV, Czech Republic 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the</p>
<p>final in the Czech indoor women's tennis tournament on Sunday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat 2-Barbara Paulus (Austria)</p>
<p>6-7 (4-7) 6-1 6-3.</p>
</text>
